  "description": "Discontinued, superseded by Gen2. This page is kept as an archive record for owners and for anyone researching an older Cotic Solaris.\n\nYears of production: 2012-2015\n\nThe Solaris is our original 29er hardtail. It was designed to bring all of the amazing qualities of the Soul to 29\" wheels: grace, durability, clean lines, fun, an interactive feel and attention to detail. The Solaris has amazing adaptability, from suspension forked, big-barred trail warrior to rigid forked map-crossing smoothie. See the Solaris and SolarisMAX archive for the later generations.\n\nIt shares a lot of great features with the evolved Gen2 Solaris, including the Reynolds 853 front triangle, up to 120mm fork compatibility, and clearance for 27.5 x 2.8\" Plus tyres.\n\nFinishes: Bright Green and Duckegg (including a matte Duckegg option).\n\nSizes: 16\" (new for 2013), 17.5\" and 19\".",
